description=v3.5.0 journaled apply/revert - every change recorded and restored. Recents by the swipe-up gesture only (no button, no long press), the apps and the time-left at the bottom of the home screen, the kernel's power-save governor for the idle CPU instead of hand-written frequency ceilings, and a screen-off sequence that no longer waits minutes for deep sleep. RMX3430.
